{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41405","headline":"寄孟宾于 · 李昉","name":"寄孟宾于","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初携书劒别湘潭，金榜标名第十三。\n昔日声名喧洛下，近来诗价满江南。\n长爲邑令情终屈，纵处曹郎志未甘。\n莫学冯唐便休去，明君晚事未爲惭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41405.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41405","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}